# Top-level Python packages for the local Google Fonts build, report, and
# package-review workflow. Keep this list small; requirements.txt is the
# pinned install snapshot generated from the active local .venv.
# drawbot-skia is installed from the maintained fork so proofs and specimen
# images render on any machine without a sibling checkout. A local checkout
# via DRAWBOT_SKIA_REPO in local.mk still takes precedence for development.
drawbot-skia @ git+https://github.com/eliheuer/drawbot-skia
fontmake
fonttools
gftools[qa]
GitPython
glyphsets
PyYAML
uharfbuzz
